# Text files are LF in every checkout, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
# kits/ is a byte-exact snapshot: tests/kits.test.mjs and gf-three's verify (check 2) compare sha256 hashes, so git
# must never convert anything in it (a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf would otherwise break every hash).
kits/** -text
# Binary assets, wherever they are.
*.glb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.hdr binary
*.wasm binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
